---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/baseLayout.astro";
import Button from "../components/button.astro";

import "../styles/event.css" ;
import "../styles/global.css" ;

import { Image } from "astro:assets";

import { OFFICIAL_LINKS } from "../data/site-config";

import YJP1 from "../assets/branding/long-logo-orange-lug-2000x550px.svg"

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
//  color test in spare directory 
--- 


<BaseLayout
title="About Us"
description="Behind the scenes at YJP">
<nav class="navigation-controls">
    <Button  variant="outline" size="xs" theme="brown" class="back-button" onclick="history.length > 1 ? history.back() : window.location.href='/events'"> ← Previous Page </Button>
</nav>

<section class="frame-fence about-section">
    <div class="about-head">  
        <h1 class="about-title full-span">About the brand </h1>
        <span class="full-span"><img src={YJP1} alt="Your Jam Plug UK" class="about-brand-logo">
        </span>
    </div>
    <div class="about-welcome block">
        <p class="open-statement">We're connecting skater's to good people, good vibes, and good skate spots.</p>
    </div>    
    <span class="separation">...</span>
    <div class="about-mission block">
        <h2 class="heading-full-width mission-title">Run by skaters, for skaters.</h2>
        <p class="mission-statement">Welcome to YJP! Originally launched in 2023, 'Your Jam Plug UK' has several goals:</p>
        
        <p class="mission-statement">1. Connecting the scattered, and sometimes isolated, roller skaters across the UK (... maybe the world?)</p>

        <p class="mission-statement">By acting as a central point of curated information, even the newest or smallest skate space can reach the right audience, and skaters can easily find the what's happening local to them.</p>

        <p class="mission-statement">2. The issue of "novelty". Many skate events focus on recreational public sessions where chaos ends up being king.</p>

        <p class="mission-statement">We're for the passionate skaters.Aiming to showcase only passion-led skate events, groups and businesses.</p>

        <p class="mission-statement">3. Growth. There is so much potential for our sport and all the disciplines under it, but the issue is often due to the lack of connection and the erratic flow of money. </p>

        <p class="mission-statement">Every pound spent with a skater-led business is a direct reinvestment into the culture. To do that, we're building a directory of skate businesses and services, eventually this will create a cycle of money that returns, ensuring that wealth cycles back to support the people who actually build the scene.</p>

        <p class="promise-statement">Everything we do is for the skaters x </p>
    </div>    

    <span class="separation">...</span>
    
    <div class="about-founder block">
        <h2 class="heading-full-width founder-title">The Founder</h2>
        
        <div class="port founder-image">
            <a href={OFFICIAL_LINKS.shaneru} target="_blank">
                <Image src="/src/assets/Skater.Shynell.JPG" alt="Me" height={320} width={260}  />
            </a>
            <span>Captured by <a href="https://danielbridlephoto.com/" class="community-credit">Daniel Bridle</a></span>
        </div>
        <div class="about-me">
            <p>Call me Shaneru!</p>

            <p>I'm a London skater and I've paid plenty of wood, gravel and concrete tax- most iconic moment was stacking it on Tower Bridge... </p>

            <p> No one asked me to build this, I just heard the peoples frustrations (along with my own) and thought of a potential solution. And honestly... I just want more places to skate.</p>

            <p>My Credentials?... Passion.</p>

            <p class="highlight-2">-CONNECTIONS & COMMUNITY-</p>

            <p>We're so close to having a GREAT skate scene, I just want to help us get there.</p>

            <blockquote class="quote-one">Spread the joy, spread the skill, watch it all thrive. <span>~ SHA.NE.RU ~</span></blockquote>
        </div>
        <div class="quote">
            
        </div>
    </div>    
    <span class="separation">...</span>
    
    <div class="about-process">
        <h2 class="heading-full-width full-span block">How it works</h2>
        
        <p>When I say "we", I mean YOU and I. This site lives off of collaborations, connections and community.</p>

        <p class="heading-small highlight-3">Here's how you can help:</p>

        <p>The skater - signs up to<a href="/newsletter-signup" class="inline-link"> the newsletter</a>.</p>

        <p>The Organiser - <a href="/submit-an-event" class="inline-link"> submit their events</a> to be listed on our calendar.</p>

        <p>The Owner -<a href="/submit-a-business" class="inline-link"> submit their business</a> to be added to the directory.</p>

        <p>Everyone -
            <a href="#official-channels" class="inline-link">
            Share the site and our socials,</a> ensure all skaters know and give feedback, cause remember, this is for all of us.
        </p>

        <p>For more details on how we work, <a href="/ourProcess" class="inline-link">head to the F.A.Q page.</a></p>
        
        <!-- <span class="separation">...</span> -->

        <div class="direction-box">
            <p><a href="/submit-an-event">Submit an Event</a></p>
            <p><a href="/submit-a-business">Submit a Group/Business</a></p>
            <p><a href="/enquiry">Join the Newsletter</a></p>
        </div>
        
        <p>Other ways to support:</p>
    
        <p> At the moment I'm a one-woman-band BUT the aim is to grow!</p>
    
        <p>So far, everything is out of my own pocket, abilities and time, so if people want to contribute, let me know!</p>
        
        <p><a href="/enquiry" class="inline-link">Drop me a message.</a></p>
        <p><a href="" class="inline-link">Donate directly</a> to the project.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="block about-channels">
        <h4 id="official-channels" class="heading-small">Our Official Channels</h4>
        <div class="channel-block">
            <div class="channel-div insta"> <a href={OFFICIAL_LINKS.instagram} target="_blank"><span>Instagram</span> <p>yourjamplug.uk</p></a></div>
            <div class="channel-div tiktok"> <a href={OFFICIAL_LINKS.tiktok} target="_blank"><span>TikTok</span> <p>Skaters.jam.plug</p></a></div>
            <!-- <div class="channel-div discord"> <a href={OFFICIAL_LINKS.discord} target="_blank"><span>Discord</span> <p>Roller Skater's Jam Plug</p></a></div> -->
        </div>
        

    </div>
    <span class="separation">...</span>

    <div class="about-process-graphic block">
        <div class="heading-full-width port process-graphic"></div>
    </div>

    <span class="separation">...</span>
    
</section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>

    .quote-one{
        padding-block: 3rem;
        font-family: var(--font-rose-body);
        font-size: var(--fs-heading-small);
        color: var(--ob-teal);
        line-height: 1.8rem;
    }

    .heading-full-width {
        width: 100%;
        height: max-content;

        line-height: 3ch;
        font-size: var(--fs-heading-mid);
        padding-left: .5rem;
        margin: .5rem 1rem;

    }

    .heading-small {
        width: 100%;
        font-size: var(--fs-p2);
        justify-self: center;
        margin-block: .5rem;
        font-weight: 800;
    }

    .inline-link{
        /* color: var(--ob-brown); */
        background-color: var(--shadow-pink);
        background-color: var(--shadow-purple);
        padding-inline: .1rem;
        border-radius: 4px;
    }
    
    .inline-link:hover{
        background-color: var(--shadow-purple);
        background-color: var(--shadow-pink);
    }

    .about-section {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        margin-top: 4rem;

    }

    .block {
        margin-block: 1.8rem;
        padding-inline: .5rem;
    }

    .separation {
        font-size: var(--fs-heading-xl);
        text-align: center;
        color: var(--mid-teal);
    }

    .about-head {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
    }
    .about-title {
        font-size: var(--fs-heading-xl);
        margin: .3ch;
        text-align: center;
    }
    
    .about-brand-logo {
        width: 100px;
        height: max-content;
        justify-items: center;
        align-items: center;
    }

    .about-welcome {
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .about-welcome .open-statement {
        padding-inline: 10vw;
        font-size: var(--fs-p2);
        text-align: center;

    }

    .about-mission {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        padding: .2rem;
        gap: 1rem;
        align-items: flex-end;
    }

    .about-mission .mission-title {
        text-align: right;
        justify-self: end;
        padding-right: 3rem;
    }
    .about-mission .mission-statement {
        text-align: right;
        width: 50ch;
        padding-right: 1rem;
    }

    .direction-box {
        padding: 2rem 1rem;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: row;
        gap: 40px;
        /* height: 120px; */
        align-items: center;
    }

    .direction-box p {
        max: 20ch;
        /* height: 40px; */
        text-align: center;
        background-color: var(--main-orange);
        padding: 2ch 2.5ch;
        border-radius: 8px;
        justify-self: center;

        transition: background-color .4s ease-in-out, color .3s ease-in-out, color .1s ease;
    }

    .direction-box p:hover {
        scale: 1.05;
        cursor: pointer;
        background-color: var(--ow-orange);
        color: var(--text-white);
    }



    .about-founder {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 30px 25% 20% 30px 20% 25% 30px;
        grid-template-rows: repeat(auto ) 3;

    }

    @media (max-width: 749px) {
        .direction-box{
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .about-founder {
            display:flex;
            flex-direction: column;

            align-items: center;
            justify-items: center;
        }

        .founder-title {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .founder-image {
            margin-block: 1rem;
        }

        .about-me {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 3rem;
        }

        
    }

    .founder-title {
        grid-row: 1 ;
        grid-column: 1 / 5;
    }

    .founder-image {

        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;

        height: 320px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        grid-row: 2;
        grid-column-end: 7;
        justify-self: end;
        
    }

    .about-me {
        grid-row: 2 /4;
        grid-column: 2 / 5;


        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 1rem;

        text-wrap: balance;

    }

    .quote {
        grid-row: 4 / 5;
        grid-column: 4 / 7;
        text-align: right;
    }

    .about-process {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: .5rem;
        text-align: center;
        justify-items: center;
        align-self: center;
        width: 80ch;
    }
    
    .about-process-graphic {
        padding: 1rem;
    }

    .process-graphic {
        width: 80%;
        justify-self: center;
        height: 110px;

        background-color: var(--main-orange);
        border-radius: 8px;
    }

    .about-support {
        /* margin-inline: 5rem; */
        /* margin-block: 3rem; */
        width: 65ch;
        align-self: center;
        text-align: center;
    }

    .channel-block {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: row;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 20px;

        
    }

    @media (max-width: 750px) {
        .channel-block {
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;

        }

        .channel-div {
            width:34ch;

        }
    }

    .channel-div {
        border: 1.5px solid var(--shadow-pink-3);
        border-radius: 18px;
        padding: 1.5rem  .5rem ;
        text-align: center;

        transition: 
        border .2s ease-in-out,
        background-color .2s ease-in-out
        ;
    }

    .channel-div:hover {
        scale: 1.05;
        border: none;
        cursor: pointer;
        background-color: var(--ow-yellow);
    }
</style>